1
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:05,296
Open a disposition again.

2
00:00:05,296 --> 00:00:08,644
After it is saved, its name cannot be changed.

3
00:00:08,644 --> 00:00:10,640
Only its description can.

4
00:00:13,654 --> 00:00:18,809
Deleting a disposition does not check whether a subject flow still uses it.

5
00:00:18,809 --> 00:00:21,164
Remove it from the flows first.

